{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Climbing Gym Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3532690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/213f9d901f8967f907d05943e33c7128.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You own a climbing gym now. Are you qualified? Absolutely not. But that\u2019s not stopping you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing Gym Simulator</strong> is a first-person management game where you design, build, and run your own indoor climbing facility. Order holds, set routes, manage chaos, and transform a dusty little warehouse into a thriving climbing empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/52b374ed02a3410cd907bfa98c773c2c.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use freeform tools to construct climbing walls and mats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decorations, furniture, and utility objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a welcoming layout that feels truly your own</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/db944b92579470c6388660d901c5e87a.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order from a variety of climbing holds and volumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place holds on any climbing wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign holds to routes with custom names, colors, and grades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/293ade4b87e20351512ba7e29aa6e2da.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your gym to NPC climbers and watch them struggle using fun ragdoll-based physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set entry, memberships, and item prices (like snacks, chalk, or rentals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with influencer visits, broken equipment, and unpredictable customer needs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/a9cbad3112a7badbc93a3303617e2394.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest profits to unlock new holds, objects and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your space and access entirely new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend skill points to streamline daily tasks and access new tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Climber</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with one climb. Now everything I own is covered in chalk, my knees are decorated with mystery bruises, and my bank account is in shambles. When I\u2019m not making this game, I\u2019m probably hanging off a wall pretending to use my legs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No budget. No team. Just one guy making the climbing game he wishes existed. This is a love letter to climbing, gaming, and making dumb decisions in the name of passion. Please support the game\u2026 I really need a new pair of climbing shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/42f52e2e3fd9545eee58d25449802919.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/213f9d901f8967f907d05943e33c7128.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You own a climbing gym now. Are you qualified? Absolutely not. But that\u2019s not stopping you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing Gym Simulator</strong> is a first-person management game where you design, build, and run your own indoor climbing facility. Order holds, set routes, manage chaos, and transform a dusty little warehouse into a thriving climbing empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/52b374ed02a3410cd907bfa98c773c2c.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use freeform tools to construct climbing walls and mats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decorations, furniture, and utility objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a welcoming layout that feels truly your own</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/db944b92579470c6388660d901c5e87a.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order from a variety of climbing holds and volumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place holds on any climbing wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign holds to routes with custom names, colors, and grades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/293ade4b87e20351512ba7e29aa6e2da.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your gym to NPC climbers and watch them struggle using fun ragdoll-based physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set entry, memberships, and item prices (like snacks, chalk, or rentals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with influencer visits, broken equipment, and unpredictable customer needs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/a9cbad3112a7badbc93a3303617e2394.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest profits to unlock new holds, objects and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your space and access entirely new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend skill points to streamline daily tasks and access new tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Climber</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with one climb. Now everything I own is covered in chalk, my knees are decorated with mystery bruises, and my bank account is in shambles. When I\u2019m not making this game, I\u2019m probably hanging off a wall pretending to use my legs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No budget. No team. Just one guy making the climbing game he wishes existed. This is a love letter to climbing, gaming, and making dumb decisions in the name of passion. Please support the game\u2026 I really need a new pair of climbing shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/42f52e2e3fd9545eee58d25449802919.avif?t=1754667609\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Run your own climbing gym in this first-person management game. Build walls, order holds, set routes, and expand your facility - all while keeping your climbers happy and preferably alive.",
